spice
* Circuit Netlist
V_in 11 9 DC
R_pi1 11 4 r_pi1
C_mu1 4 3 C_mu1
C_pi1 4 5 C_pi1
G_m1 5 2 3 2 gm1
R_E1 5 6 R_E1
R_pi2 6 7 r_pi2
C_pi2 7 22 C_pi2
G_m2 5 9 22 2 gm2

* Nodes
* 1 = Not used
* 2 = Common ground
* 3 = Node connected to G_m1 and C_mu1
* 4 = Node connected between R_pi1, C_pi1, and C_mu1
* 5 = Node connected to G_m1, R_E1, and another ground
* 6 = Node connected between R_E1 and R_pi2
* 7 = Node connected to R_pi2 and C_pi2
* 8 = Not used
* 9 = Common ground
* 10 = Not used
* 11 = Node connected to V_in and R_pi1
* 22 = Node connected between C_pi2 and G_m2

.END